#: src/pages/About.vue:8 src/pages/Statistics.vue:10
msgid "What's the Damage"
msgstr "What's the Damage"

#: src/pages/About.vue:9
msgid ""
"This tool is designed to process your bank account transactions in CSV "
"files. It categorizes the transactions and generate insightful reports."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:10
msgid ""
"Efforts were made to be able to customize the behavior and potentially work "
"with any CSV format finance companies may produce."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:12
msgid "The problem it solves"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:13
msgid ""
"While my bank service provider provides reports about my finances they are "
"not detailed enough, hence this tool was created to give more insights."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:14
msgid ""
"Also my financial details are a private matter between myself and my chosen "
"bank. To process my bank account exports, I need a solution that ensures "
"only I have access to the data."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:15
msgid ""
"This application does not keep or sell any of your data. All uploaded "
"content is removed as soon as the cache is expired. Cache is only used for "
"your convenience."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:17
msgid "Main Features"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:19
msgid "Automated Categorization"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:19
msgid ""
"Categorizes transactions into well-known accounting categories such as "
"deposits, payments, grocery, etc."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:20
#, fuzzy
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "Filters"

#: src/pages/About.vue:20
msgid ""
"Filter transactions by start and end dates, or group them by month for a "
"comprehensive overview of your finances."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:21
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:21
msgid ""
"Generate summarized reports that provide insights into your spending habits, "
"grouped by transaction categories."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:22 src/pages/Categories.vue:405
#: src/pages/PivotTable.vue:49 src/pages/PivotTable.vue:307
#: src/pages/PivotTable.vue:308
msgid "Pivot Table"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:22
msgid ""
"View your transactions in a pivot table format, allowing you to analyze your "
"spending patterns and trends over time."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:25
msgid "The technical problem of categorizing transactions"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:26
msgid ""
"The very heart of the application is the categorization of transactions."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:27
msgid ""
"The transaction metadata while it contains useful information, is often "
"incomplete or inconsistent. The most valuable information, the merchant "
"identifier, is the least reliable to count on."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:28
msgid ""
"There is no formal requirements imposed by service providers about its "
"format and its value can be changed at any time by merchants."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:29
msgid ""
"Another significant drawback is that merchant identifiers are quite "
"variable, so there are no rules of thumb to follow."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:31
msgid ""
"The application provides several categorization technologies to solve this "
"problem."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:33
msgid "The most reliable"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:34
msgid ""
"The application by default uses a ruleset which completely ignores merchant "
"information and only considers the transaction type and the mathematical "
"sign of the amounts."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:35
msgid ""
"While this method is considered stable, it provides less insights and can "
"only distinguish a limited number of categories."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:35
msgid "This method is recommended only for quick setups."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:37
msgid "The most accurate"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:38
msgid ""
"The most accurate categorization results can be achieved using regular "
"expressions which also takes into account the merchant identifier."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:39
msgid ""
"However creating and maintaining these rules is a time-consuming process and "
"requires deeper technical knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:40
msgid "Additionally, the rulesets are not easily shareable with other users."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:40
msgid "This method is recommended only for experienced users."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:42
msgid "The most advanced"
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:43
msgid ""
"The application can use a Machine Learning model for categorization. Such "
"models are trained on tens of thousands of transactions and can categorize "
"transactions into a wide range of categories."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:44
msgid ""
"The advantage is that it need less maintenance and provides many more "
"categories."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:45
msgid ""
"The disadvantage is that - depending on the size of the data used for "
"training - there may be transactions that fall into the 'Other' category."
msgstr ""

#: src/pages/About.vue:45
msgid "This method is currently unavailable for general use."
msgstr ""

